,"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]啊……书皮上有我的名字，看来这是我的书了。这是一本在魔爪湖非常流行的武侠小说，我小时候非常喜欢看。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"没想到埃迪蒂还喜欢看武侠小说啊。","tag":"tag_17"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara041_1\": \"06\"\r    }\r  },\r  \"action\": \"bubble\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm]","charaName":"","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]这……这也不是什么奇怪的事情吧。当时这本书小孩子们都爱看，我也只是其中之一而已。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]当年看完这本小说后，内心一直有着对侠客那种行侠仗义、自由散漫的向往。所以我最初的梦想，就是成为一名剑技高超的契约者，走遍整个卡露蒂亚大陆。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]这种想法一直持续到大兽潮到来，面对那些狂暴化的魔物，我发现我谁也保护不了，包括唯一抚养我的奶奶在内……那天我失去了我的家园。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]看着我身边剩余的朋友，贝尔卡还有阿莱克西娅，我发誓我绝不能再失去他们。我的思想也从那天开始改变，比起浪迹天涯的侠客生活，我更在乎保护身边的一切。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]从那时候开始，我的梦想便从逍遥自在的契约者变成了保护家乡的执剑人。大兽潮结束后我就加入了图洛德组织的护卫队，一步一步做到了治安队长的位置。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"埃迪蒂有着很励志的过往呢。","tag":"tag_24"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]谈不上什么励志，只是有些起伏罢了。上次听了你的建议后我就想回望一下我的过去，没想到一下子能想起来这么多的事情。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我最初也是有着单纯的梦想，但最后还是在现实的冲击下破碎了。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"虽然埃迪蒂不像侠客那样自由。","tag":"tag_27"},{"text":"但埃迪蒂保护了身边的许多人。","tag":"tag_27"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"在我心中，你已经是一名侠客了。","tag":"tag_28"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]谢谢你的鼓励，{myName}。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我之前满脑子想着要承担责任，现在看来确实是有些太固执了。偶尔停下脚步看看四周、回望过去，确实能让我领悟到不一样的感觉。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]能在陪我走一走吗？我还想和你一起在谈谈我以前的事情……可以吗？[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"乐意之至。","tag":"tag_32"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]嗯……我们去那边看看吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我小时候很喜欢爬树，当年我和贝尔卡阿莱克西娅一起……[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","noIn":false,"x":-500,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5,"bright":1,"layer":"fore","y":-12